# Formation Breaker (2/1): "Creatures with power less than this creature's power can't block it" (CR 509.1b). Bot2's Ornithopter (power 0) may not block it, but its Savannah
# Lions (power 2, not less than 2) may, and the two trade. No creature has a counter, so the Breaker has no bonus.

